{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bufferDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV","text":"BufferDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"title":"bufferDropReports","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"externalID":"s:12Destinations8DeliveryV17bufferDropReports11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVyAA06BufferD6ReportVGvp","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Delivery.swift#L50","fileName":"Delivery.swift"},"symbolKind":"property"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of the batches each destination’s full buffer drops, in the order they are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bufferDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/BufferDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BufferDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports no one has read yet merge, one per destination: a destination’s later drops add","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"their record counts to its waiting report and widen its timestamps, so the reports waiting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are at most one per destination, and a late reader still learns every count lost. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence ends once this delivery, every copy of it and every unit of work built on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/work"},{"text":" are gone, their executions have returned, and every report has been read. Read","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sequence into a constant before starting the task that reads it, so the task holds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reports and not the delivery.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order. A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/bufferDropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery\/bufferdropreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"title":"AsyncQueue","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Delivery/bufferDropReports":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bufferDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV","text":"BufferDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"bufferDropReports","abstract":[{"text":"A report of the batches each destination’s full buffer drops, in the order they are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery\/bufferdropreports","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/bufferDropReports"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/BufferDropReport":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BufferDropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"BufferDropReport","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Batches a destination’s full buffer dropped before the destination received them."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/bufferdropreport","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BufferDropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/BufferDropReport","type":"topic"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Delivery/work":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The unit of work that delivers: executing it runs the delivery."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/work","type":"topic","title":"work","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery\/work","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"work"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DeferredTask","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent12DeferredTaskC"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Where tracked events go: the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Destination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","url":"\/documentation\/destinations","title":"Destinations","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Delivery":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The work of delivering a sequence’s batches to destinations, made by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deliver(to:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports of the batches their full buffers drop."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery","type":"topic","title":"Delivery","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Delivery","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Delivery","kind":"identifier"}]}}}